00:00:07.912 --> 00:00:09.829
I wake up every morning

00:00:11.695 --> 00:00:14.598
(typing sounds)

00:00:14.598 --> 00:00:16.472
- My name is Alex Parish,

00:00:16.472 --> 00:00:20.543
protecting our country
had always been my dream.

00:00:20.543 --> 00:00:22.056
I went to go as my first audition

00:00:22.056 --> 00:00:25.946
I knew I had to go in
to this room and read

00:00:25.946 --> 00:00:28.209
these lines in front of all these people

00:00:28.209 --> 00:00:30.338
but I was so nervous before I went in,

00:00:30.338 --> 00:00:32.330
so I went to the bathroom I remember,

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:33.948
before I went in and I
looked in the mirror,

00:00:33.948 --> 00:00:36.606
and this is so stupid and cliche,

00:00:36.606 --> 00:00:38.403
but I talked to myself and I said,

00:00:38.403 --> 00:00:39.655
"What's wrong with you?

00:00:39.655 --> 00:00:42.615
You've played the most
difficult characters

00:00:42.615 --> 00:00:45.524
in the most complicated movies

00:00:45.524 --> 00:00:46.997
I tossed my hair a little bit,

00:00:46.997 --> 00:00:49.164
felt great and walked out.

00:00:51.126 --> 00:00:54.042
Did my bit and got the job.

00:00:54.042 --> 00:00:55.699
(laughing)

00:00:55.699 --> 00:00:56.532
(music plays)

00:00:56.532 --> 00:00:58.427
- I wake up every morning,

00:00:58.427 --> 00:01:00.344
espresso keep me going.

